  "solution": {
    "text": "General equation of travelling wave is<br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">f</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">ax</mtext><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mo>&#177;&#160;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">bt</mtext></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">f</mtext><mfenced><mrow><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">x</mtext><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mo>&#177;&#160;</mo><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">vt</mtext></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">y</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mtext>e</mtext><mrow><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">ax</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">bt</mtext><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">ab</mtext></msqrt><mtext>&#160;</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">xt</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mtext>e</mtext><mrow><mo>-</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">a</mtext></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mo>&#160;+</mo><msqrt><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">b</mtext><mtext>&#160;</mtext></msqrt><mi>t</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;</mo></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></msup></math><br /><br />So, the wave will be travelling along - x-axis with speed <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mfrac><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">b</mtext><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">a</mtext></mfrac></msqrt></math>.",
